+chooseProxy</H3>
+<PRE>
+protected <A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/net/Proxy.html" title="class or interface in java.net">Proxy</A> <B>chooseProxy</B>(<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/util/List.html" title="class or interface in java.util">List</A>&lt;<A HREF="http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/api/java/net/Proxy.html" title="class or interface in java.net">Proxy</A>&gt;&nbsp;proxies,
