+<DT><B>Parameters:</B><DD><CODE>proxies</CODE> - the list of proxies to choose from,
+                  never <code>null</code> or empty<DD><CODE>target</CODE> - the planned target, never <code>null</code><DD><CODE>request</CODE> - the request to be sent, never <code>null</code><DD><CODE>context</CODE> - the context, or <code>null</code>
+<DT><B>Returns:</B><DD>a proxy type</DL>
+</DD>
+</DL>
