+getPoolEntry</H3>
+<PRE>
+<A HREF="../../../../../../org/apache/http/impl/conn/tsccm/BasicPoolEntry.html" title="class in org.apache.http.impl.conn.tsccm">BasicPoolEntry</A> <B>getPoolEntry</B>(long&nbsp;timeout,
