+<DT><PRE>public interface <B>Cancellable</B></DL>
+</PRE>
+
+<P>
+A <tt>Cancellable</tt> represents a process or an operation that can be
+ canceled.
+<P>
+
+<P>
+<DL>
+<DT><B>Since:</B></DT>
