+public boolean <B>isStreaming</B>()</PRE>
+<DL>
+<DD><B>Description copied from interface: <CODE><A HREF="../../../../org/apache/http/HttpEntity.html#isStreaming()">HttpEntity</A></CODE></B></DD>
