+  <li><A HREF="../../../../../org/apache/http/params/CoreConnectionPNames.html#MAX_LINE_LENGTH"><CODE>CoreConnectionPNames.MAX_LINE_LENGTH</CODE></A></li>
+ </ul>
+<P>
